"freed" explanation:O'zini qo'rqinchli vaziyatdan chiqarish, azobdan ozod etish.
"hospitalised" explanation: Bolani xonaga yuborish, tibbiy yordam ko'rish uchun bo'lgan joyga olib borish.
"relocated" explanation:Joylashuvini o'zgartirish.
"charged with" explanation: Jinoiy aybdan so'zlashish (yoki jinoiy aybdan aytdirish).
"tainted" explanation: Ifodasi buzilgan, noyoblik yo'qotilgan.
"potentially prejudicial" explanation: Ehtimoliy nozik yoki noto'g'ri ta'sir ko'rsatadigan.
"walking a dangerous line" explanation: Xavfli chiziq bo'ylab yurish (xavfli yoki noaniq holatda harakatlanish).
"indictment" explanation:Hududiy jinoyat yoki jinoyatga qarshi hujjatli aybdorlik haqida rasmiy e'lon qilish.
"refer to" explanation: Haqida aytmak, qaytish, ishora qilish.
"cover" explanation:Mavzuni qamrab olish, muhokama qilish.
"ongoing military presence" explanation:Doimiy military mavjudlik.
"supervised" explanation:Nazorat qilinadi.
"qualified volunteers" explanation: Malakali xodimlar
"comprehensive" explanation: Keng va chuqur.
"swore in" explanation: Davlat vazifasiga yuritish (yoki qo‘shimcha ravishda, amalga oshirish) – ma’lum bir shaxsni vazifasiga qo‘yish, unga so‘z berish (masalan, siyosiy yoki davlat vazifasiga) va uning vazifasini boshlashi uchun qo‘shimcha ravishda so‘z berish.
"CEP" explanation: Davlat boshlig'ining yoki hukumatning asosiy dasturi yoki strategiyasi (Xalqaro iqtisodiy siyosat).
"prior CEP's resignation" explanation: Old CEPning iste'fosi.
"response to" explanation: Nega bo'lgani yoki reaksiya sifatida.
"triggered by" explanation:Sabab bo'lib xizmat qilgan.
"malfunctioning" explanation:Xato ishlayotgan, noto'g'ri ishlayotgan.
"be aware of" explanation: Nima haqida bilish, e'tibor berish.
"non-serious" explanation: O'ziga xos xavfli bo'lmagan, jiddiy bo'lmagan.
"postponement" explanation: Bekor qilish yoki o'z vaqtidan keyin qilish.
"struck" explanation: Yerga urilish, hujum qilish (bu yerda "earthquake" — zilzila) — zilzila sodir bo'lish.
"no damages reported" explanation: Xarobliklar haqida xabar berilmagan.
"no Tsunami indication" explanation: Tsunami haqida hech qanday belgi yo'q.
"kept...hostage" explanation:O'ziga bog'lab, xavfsizlikka xavf tug'dirish.
"fired" explanation: O'q atish, quroldan o'q chiqarish.
"confirmed dead" explanation:O'lik sifatida tasdiqlangan.
"were released early" explanation: O'tkazilgan vaqtidan oldin osib chiqarilish.
"gunned down" explanation: O'q bilan o'ldirish, qo'rqinchli tarzda o'ldirish.
"follow in someone’s footsteps" explanation:O'g'il ota ishlarini davom ettirish.
"obstetrician" explanation:O'zak yoki bolani tug'irish bo'yicha mutaxassis doktor.
"investigate" explanation:O'rganish, tekshirish.
"speed up" explanation:Tezlashtirish.
"black box" explanation:Uchish ma'lumotlarini saqlaydigan qora quticha.
"pay tribute to someone" explanation:Kimni hurmat qilish, uning xotirasiga ijobiy qarash ko'rsatish.
"night of two moons" explanation: Ikki oyning bir vaqtning o'zida ko'rinishi (ma'noda — juda noyob, o'ziga xos voqea).
"as freaky as me" explanation: Menimdek noyob, o'ziga xos, noyob bo'lish.
"oppose" explanation:Qarshilik ko'rish.
"become a republic" explanation:Respublikaga aylanish.
"share this view" explanation: Bunday fikrga ega bo'lish.
"at the extremes of the poll" explanation: So'rovning ekstremal qismida (so'rov natijalarining eng yuqori yoki eng past darajasida).
"due to" explanation: Sabab bo'lishi sababli.
"take the drugs" explanation:Dori-lakazlarni qabul qilish.
"discovered" explanation:Kashf qilish.
"verify" explanation:Tekshirish, tasdiqlash.
"water delivery" explanation:Suvni yetkazib berish.
"collided with" explanation: Bir-biriga urilib ketish.
"legalizing" explanation:Qonuniy qilish, huquqiy qilish.
"political chatter and silliness" explanation: Siyosiy suhbatlar va bevosita so'zlar.
"make a run for" explanation:Presidentlikka namoyish qilish, sayohat qilish (namoyish qilish — siyosiy positsiyaga aralashish).
"cut carbon emissions" explanation:Karbon emissiyasini kamaytirish.
"pinpoint" explanation:Aniq joyini aniqlash.
"park-and-ride" explanation:Avtomashina bilan yurib kelib, avtomashinasini xavfsiz joyga qo'yib, keyin boshqa transport vositasidan foydalanish (avtomashina qo'yish va transportga o'tish) usuli.
"behind closed doors" explanation:Ogohlantirishsiz, xodimlarning tashqi kishilardan uzoqda o'tkaziladigan (barcha xodimlarning yoki a'zolarning qatnashmagan holda o'tkaziladigan) match.
"published on Thursday" explanation: Paytga e'lon qilindi.
"evolved in just two generations" explanation: Faqat ikki avlod ichida rivojlanish.
"worked into" explanation: Bir narsaga shakl berish, ishlab chiqarish.
"pulled into thin wire" explanation: Yengil simga sushiriladi.
"illuminated manuscripts" explanation: Yorug'lik bilan bezatilgan hujjatlar (ko'pincha diniy matnlarni o'z ichiga olgan qadimiy kitoblar).
"pH" explanation: Kimyoviy moddaning kislotalik yoki baziklik darajasi.
"acidic or basic (alkaline)" explanation:Kislotali yoki asosli (bazik)
"indicated by" explanation: Ko'rsatilgan, belgilangan.
"strip off" explanation:Olib tashlash, yoki narsaning bir qismini ajratib olish.
"swirl" explanation:Yaxshi aralashtirish, aylantirib aralashtirish.
"react with" explanation: Bir-biriga ta'sir qilish, reaksiyaga kirish.
"flush toilet" explanation:Suv bilan yuviladigan to'liq xonalik.
"Remains" explanation: Qoldiqlar.
"mixed company" explanation:Turli jinsdagi odamlar birga bo'lgan jamoa.
"using a satellite" explanation: Sputnikdan foydalanish.
"reflect" explanation:O'tkazib yuborish, aynan shunday qaytarib yuborish.
"distorts" explanation:Nurlarni boshqacha ko'rishga olib kelish, buzish.
"over a 100 feet high" explanation: 100 futdan yuqori.
"change the world" explanation:Dunyoni o'zgartirish.
"transportation devices" explanation: Transport vositalari.
"medium sized" explanation: O'rta hajmdagi.
"small prey" explanation:Kichik o'qiladigan hayvonlar.
"niche" explanation:Maxsus, alohida vazifa yoki joy.
"pride" explanation: Sharaf, shuhrat; (hayvonlar uchun) guruh.
"along with" explanation: Birlashgan holda, birgalikda.
"being a large family of sisters and daughters" explanation: Akalari va o'g'illari bo'lgan katta oila bo'lish.
