"national football team" explanation: Milliy futbol jamoasi.
"motor racing" explanation:Mashina sayohati, avtomashina g'oytasi.
"competing in" explanation:Qatnashish, musobaqalarda ishtirok etish.
"holds" explanation: Egallash, ega bo'lish (bu yerda geografik so'zda yoki joylarni o'zida boshqarish ma'nosida).
"archipelago" explanation:Orol guruhi.
"way back" explanation: Eski vaqtga, qadimiy davrlarga qaytish.
"initiating a transformation" explanation:O'zgarishlarni boshlash, o'zgarishlarga sabab bo'lish.
"take control of" explanation: Bir joyni nazorat qilishga olish.
"cede sovereignty" explanation:Hukmronlik huquqini topshirish.
"consist of" explanation: Ikkita yoki undan ko'p qismdan tashkil topish.
"give someone a better idea" explanation:Kimnidir nima ekanligi haqida yaxshiroq tasavvurga ega bo'lishiga yordam berish.
"restoration" explanation:Ta'mirlash, qayta tiklash.
"dominant" explanation: Aksariyat yoki boshqaruvchi bo'lish.
"aspect ratio" explanation:Rasmning uzunlik va eni nisbati.
"somewhat confusingly" explanation: Bir oz nozik, tushunish qiyin bo'lishi mumkin.
"aspect ratio" explanation:Nisbat o'lchovi.
"equal to or closely approximate" explanation: Teng yoki yaqin taxmin bilan mos kelish.
"rule of thirds" explanation: Rasmni qulay tuzish uchun ishlatiladigan oddiy qoida, bu qoida rasmga harakat va tartibni birga kiritadi.
"divide the image into thirds" explanation:Rasmni vertikal va gorizontal yo'nalishda uch qismga bo'lish.
"come under scrutiny" explanation:Kuzatuvga tushish, tekshiruvga duch kelish.
"bind together" explanation: Bir-biriga bog'lash, birlashitirish.
"all-pervading" explanation:Barcha narsalarni o'ziga olish, hamma narsaga aralashuvchi.
"alleviate suffering" explanation:O'likni yengish, xushbo'ylashni kamaytirish.
"concentration of power and money" explanation:Kuch va pulning markazlashtirilishi.
"naval blockade" explanation: Dengiz blokadosi.
"cutting off" explanation:Biror narsani to'xtatish, o'ziga yoki boshqasiga yetkazishni bekor qilish.
"mine" explanation:Okean bo'ylab xavfli maydonlarni minaga aylantirish.
"unrestricted submarine warfare" explanation:Cheklanmagan suv osti urush usuli.
"prevailing attitudes" explanation: Hukmron fikrlar, aksariyat odamlarning va mamlakatlarning asosiy fikrlari.
"avoid such a situation" explanation:Shunday holatdan qochish.
"accept a job" explanation:Ishni qabul qilish.
"to his name" explanation: O'zida bo'lgan pul yoki narsa.
"dynasty" explanation: Davlatni boshqaruvchi oila yoki hukmron oila.
"Three Kingdoms epoch" explanation: Han va Jin dinastiyalari o'rtasida 60 yil davom etgan, uchta poytaxtning bo'linishiga oid mashhur davr.
"fighting for the throne" explanation: Tron uchun jang qilish.
"bloodiest era" explanation:Eng qonli davr.
"shift from absolutism to republicanism" explanation: Absolyutizmdan respublikachilikka o'tish.
"open to all male applicants" explanation: Barcha erkak so'rovchilarga ochiq bo'lish.
"same goes for" explanation: Boshqalarga ham shunday.
"inspired" explanation:O'ziga qo'rqish, xayol yoki harakatga undash.
"frequent" explanation: Ko'p marta tashqi yoki ma'lum joyga borish, tez-tez u yerda bo'lish.
"spiritual inclinations" explanation: Imaniyotga qiziquvchanlik, ruhiy yo'nalishlar.
"completely isolated" explanation:Butunlay izolyatsiyalangan.
"total isolation" explanation:To'liq izolyatsiya.
"be seen or heard" explanation: Ko'rinadi yoki eshitiladi bo'lish.
"still standing" explanation: Hozir ham mavjud bo'lish, turg'un bo'lib qolish.
