"Valley of the Dead" explanation: O'liklar vodiysi.
"honor" explanation:Shon-sharaf berish, hurmat qilish.
"up bow" mark explanation: Yuqori chiziq belgisi (V shakliga o'xshaydi).   "down bow" mark explanation: Pastki chiziq belgisi (konsol yoki pastki tomoni yo'q kvadratga o'xshaydi).
"Up" and "down" explanation: Yuqori va pastga harakatlanish, bu yerda "up" — o'qning uchidan boshlab, chizish; "down" — o'qning bosh (qo'lingiz o'qni ushlab turgan qismi) dan boshlab, o'qni tortish.
"up-bow" explanation: Yuqoriga siljish (violin yoki boshqa satrikli instrumentda chiziq yoki chalish harakati).
"pencil in" explanation:Qog'ozga yozish, qo'shish (tavsiya yoki taxminiy ravishda).
"forced back" explanation: Boshqalarning qarshilik qilishiga qaramay, qaytishga majbur qilish.
"surrounded by a mob" explanation:Odam guruhiga o'rab olingan.
"have their carriage windows wide open" explanation:O'zining o'rqon o'qishlarini keng ochib qo'yish.
"wave in front of" explanation: Qo'rqinchli holatda kimga nazar solish, ko'z oldiga chiqarish.
"paid for by" explanation: To'lovlarni olib berish, xarajatlarni qoplash.
"defray" explanation: Xarajatlarni qoplash.
"protracted exploitation" explanation: Uzoq muddat davom etgan bosib olish yoki foydalanish.
"prompted" explanation:Sabab bo'lib xizmat qilgan.
"High Middle Ages" explanation: Yüksak O'rta asr – Yevropada 11, 12 va 13 asrlarda (M. asr 1000–1300 yillar) davom etgan davr.
"preceded by" explanation:Oldin kelgan, avvalgi davr bilan bog'liq bo'lish.
"technological determinism" explanation:Texnologik qaror — bu inson qismi, jamiyat va tarixni texnologik rivojlanishning o'ziga xos qonuniyatlari va ularning texnologiyalarda namoyon bo'lishi orqali boshqarilishini anglatadi.
"technological determinism" explanation:Texnologik qaror — bu texnologik rivojlanishning ijtimoiy yoki siyosiy ta'sirlardan mustaqil ravishda rivojlanishini va texnologiyaning jamiyatga o'ziga xos ta'sir ko'rsatishini ifodalovchi fikr.
"necessarily leads to" explanation: Azolariga qaramay, natijada olib keladi.
"economically viable" explanation: Iqtisodiy jihatdan foydali yoki amalga oshirish mumkin.
"incidence" explanation:Hodisa yoki voqealarning sodir bo'lish tezligi, sodir bo'lish chastotasi.
"drawn from" explanation: Boshqalardan olingan, manbalangan.
"arbitrarily imposed laws" explanation:Ixtiyoriy qo‘yilgan qonunlar.
"regarded as" explanation: Qabul qilinadi, hisoblanadi.
"epicenter" explanation: Markaziy nuqta, asosiy joy.
"bear gifts" explanation:Hediyalar bilan kelish.
"transfer of the title" explanation: Unvoning o'tkazilishi.
"peaked" explanation: Pikka yetish, eng yuqori darajaga erishish.
"heavily influenced" explanation:Kuchli ta'sir qilgan.
"lag behind" explanation:O'zini oldinga qo'yishdan ma'naviy yoki texnik jihatdan qolish.
"fasten clothing" explanation:Kiyimlarni yopish, yoki yopish uchun qo'llash.
"subsistence agriculture" explanation:O'ziga va oilasiga kerakli mahsulotlarni yetkazish uchun amalga oshiriladigan sanoat.
"subsistence agriculture" explanation: O'zini-ozini saqlash maqsadida amalga oshiriladigan, o'z eko-mahallasi sharoitiga mos keladigan, o'ziga xos bo'lgan tayyorlangan bo'z va o'zgaruvchan o'tkazib yurish yoki boshqa oddiy usullardan foydalaniladigan o'ziga xos qishloq xo'jaligi tizimi.
"subsistence agriculture" explanation: O'ziga va oilasiga yetarli o'ziga xos o'tkazish uchun mehnat qilish, o'zini o'zini qondirish uchun qilinadigan sanoat.
"like-minded" explanation:O'xshash fikrlarga ega bo'lgan.
"distinctive" explanation:Maxsus, ajratilgan, noyob.
"distinct" explanation:Albatta ajratilgan, noyob.
"signal their membership" explanation:O'ziga xos a'zolikni bildirish.
"draw upon" explanation: Bir narsani foydalanish, ishlatish.
"feral" explanation: Tabiiy, o'ziga xos xususiyatlarga ega bo'lgan, odamlar bilan aloqada bo'lmagan, o'ziga xos hayot o'tkazayotgan.
"feral children" explanation:O'ziga xos xulq-atvorlari rivojlanmagan, jamiyat bilan aloqasi bo'lmagan bolalar.
"brought up by animals" explanation: Hayvonlar tomonidan tarbiyalangan.
"feral child" explanation: O'ziga xos o'rganish sharoitida o'stirilgan, odamlar orasida o'smagan, tabiiy hayvonlarning ta'siri ostida shakllangan bola.
"goes a step beyond" explanation: Bir qadam oldinga chiqish, nishonni oshirish.
"undergoing a new learning experience" explanation:Yangi o'rganish tajribasini o'tkazayotgan.
" scaffold " explanation: Yordam beruvchi vosita yoki tushuntiruvchi tizim.
"internalized" explanation:Ichki o'rganish, o'ziga xos qilish.
"extortion" explanation:Bo'zib olish, bosqichli olib ketish.
"nurturing" explanation:Tarbiya qiluvchi, mehribon va rivojlanishga yordam beruvchi.
"perceive" explanation: Nishonlanish, his qilish.
"reliable health care" explanation:Isbotlanadigan, ishonchli tibbiy xizmat.
"necessities" explanation:Zarur atrof-muhit yoki me'murlar.
"combine" explanation: Bir yoki bir nechta narsalarni birlashtirish.
"uses and gratifications approach" explanation:Foydalanish va qondirish yo'li.
"learning" explanation:O'rganish.
"personal involvement" explanation: Shaxsiy qo‘shilish, shaxsiy qatnashish.
"micro-expressions" explanation: Bir necha millisekund davom etadigan yuz ifodasi.
"micro-expressions" explanation:Kichik, tez o'tadigan yuz ifodasi.
"assess sincerity" explanation:Ishonchli bo'lish darajasini aniqlash.
"interpret" explanation:O'zini his qilish, tushunish, ma'nosi va maqsadini aniqlash.
"genetic variation" explanation:Genetik o'zgaruvchanlik.
"remove it from the pool" explanation: Biror narsani umumiy mavjud variantlar to'plamidan chiqarish.
"shuffle variation back and forth" explanation:O'zgaruvchanlikni ikkita guruhto'g'ri o'zaro almashtirish.
" satisfy its amino-acid requirements" explanation: O'simlik resurslaridan olinadigan aminokislotalar ega bo'lishni qondirish.
"growth depression" explanation: O'sishning sekinlashishi.
"readily accessible" explanation: Qulay ravishda ochiladigan, tezda topiladigan.
"high-quantity proteins" explanation: Yuqori miqdordagi proteinlar.
"all things considered" explanation: Barcha narsalarni hisobga olib, jami hisobga olinganda.
"Sleep interruption" explanation: Odatiy uyqu davrida maqsadli uyg'otilish va so'ng qisqa muddat (10–60 minut) ichida yana uyquga kirish jarayoni.
"bring you to consciousness" explanation:Sizni xotira holatiga keltirish.
"reset the clock" explanation: Soatni qayta sozlash.
"diuretic" explanation:Idrok ajratishga olib keladigan, idrok ajratishni tezlashtiradigan.
"correlates oppositely" explanation: Boshqa narsaga teskari bog'lanish, teskari munosabatda bo'lish.
"absolute peace" explanation: Mutlaq damlilik, to'liq sadoqat.
"standing in the way" explanation:Maqsadga erishishni oldini olish, yo'lni tashlab qo'ymoq.
"extended by" explanation:Boshqalarning ta'limlariga qo'shilish, kengaytirish.
